    {
      "id": "about-1",
      "name": "Split Story About",
      "description": "Bold left text with a full-bleed image on the right",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ab1-wrap{font-family:sans-serif;min-height:600px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n                          .ab1-left{flex:1;min-width:300px;background:#111;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:80px 60px;}\n                          .ab1-title{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,48px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;margin:20px 0 25px 0;}\n                          .ab1-stats{display:flex;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n                          .ab1-right{flex:1;min-width:300px;background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover;min-height:500px;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.ab1-left{padding:50px 30px;} .ab1-stats{gap:20px;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ab1-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"ab1-left\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <span style=\"color: #e67e22; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px;\">Our Story</span>\n                                    <h2 class=\"ab1-title\">We build things<br>that <span style=\"color: #e67e22;\">matter.</span></h2>\n                                    <p style=\"color: #aaa; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 30px 0; max-width: 480px;\">Founded in 2015, we started with a simple belief: great software should empower people, not complicate their lives. Today, we serve over 50,000 customers globally.</p>\n                                    <div class=\"ab1-stats\">\n                                        <div>\n                                            <div style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 900; color: #e67e22;\">10+</div>\n                                            <div style=\"color: #777; font-size: 14px;\">Years Experience</div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div>\n                                            <div style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 900; color: #e67e22;\">50K+</div>\n                                            <div style=\"color: #777; font-size: 14px;\">Happy Clients</div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div>\n                                            <div style=\"font-size: 40px; font-weight: 900; color: #e67e22;\">120+</div>\n                                            <div style=\"color: #777; font-size: 14px;\">Team Members</div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"ab1-right\"></div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "about-2",
      "name": "Mission & Values",
      "description": "Clean light layout with mission statement and value cards",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ab2-wrap{padding:100px 20px;background:#ffffff;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .ab2-title{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#111;margin:15px 0 20px 0;}\n                          .ab2-desc{max-width:650px;margin:0 auto;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,18px);color:#555;line-height:1.7;}\n                          .ab2-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:30px;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.ab2-wrap{padding:60px 20px;} .ab2-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ab2-wrap\">\n                            <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n                                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 70px;\">\n                                    <span style=\"color: #6366f1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px;\">Who We Are</span>\n                                    <h2 class=\"ab2-title\">A team driven by purpose</h2>\n                                    <p class=\"ab2-desc\">We're a diverse group of designers, developers, and dreamers united by one shared mission - to make the web a better place for everyone.</p>\n                                </div>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"ab2-grid\">\n                                    <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 40px 30px; border-radius: 16px; background: #f8f8ff; border: 1px solid #e0e7ff;\">\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">🎯</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e1b4b; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Mission</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">To empower creators with tools that are both powerful and beautifully simple.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 40px 30px; border-radius: 16px; background: #fdf4ff; border: 1px solid #f0abfc;\">\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">👁️</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #581c87; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Vision</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">A world where anyone can build professional digital experiences without barriers.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 40px 30px; border-radius: 16px; background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #86efac;\">\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">💚</div>\n                                        <h3 style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #14532d; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">Values</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Integrity, creativity, and relentless focus on our users' success in everything we do.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "about-3",
      "name": "Dark Timeline About",
      "description": "Engaging company history presented as a vertical timeline",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ab3-wrap{padding:100px 20px;background:#09090b;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .ab3-title{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,42px);font-weight:800;margin:0 0 15px 0;}\n                          .ab3-timeline{position:relative;padding-left:50px;}\n                          .ab3-line{position:absolute;left:18px;top:0;bottom:0;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom, #6366f1, #ec4899);}\n                          .ab3-item{margin-bottom:50px;position:relative;}\n                          .ab3-item-last{position:relative;}\n                          .ab3-dot{position:absolute;left:-40px;top:5px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid #09090b;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.ab3-wrap{padding:60px 20px;} .ab3-timeline{padding-left:30px;} .ab3-line{left:8px;} .ab3-dot{left:-30px;} .ab3-item h3{font-size:20px;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ab3-wrap\">\n                            <div style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n                                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 70px;\">\n                                    <h2 class=\"ab3-title\">Our Journey</h2>\n                                    <p style=\"color: #71717a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0;\">From a small garage startup to a global platform.</p>\n                                </div>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"ab3-timeline\">\n                                    <div class=\"ab3-line\"></div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"ab3-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"ab3-dot\" style=\"background: #6366f1; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #6366f1;\"></div>\n                                        <span style=\"color: #6366f1; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">2015</span>\n                                        <h3 style=\"color: #fff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 10px 0;\">The Beginning</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #71717a; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Three friends in a garage with a laptop and a big dream. We built our first prototype in 72 sleepless hours.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"ab3-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"ab3-dot\" style=\"background: #a855f7; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #a855f7;\"></div>\n                                        <span style=\"color: #a855f7; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">2018</span>\n                                        <h3 style=\"color: #fff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 10px 0;\">Series A Funding</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #71717a; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Secured $5M in Series A funding, allowing us to grow our team from 3 to 40 passionate individuals.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"ab3-item-last\">\n                                        <div class=\"ab3-dot\" style=\"background: #ec4899; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #ec4899;\"></div>\n                                        <span style=\"color: #ec4899; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;\">2024</span>\n                                        <h3 style=\"color: #fff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 10px 0;\">Global Scale</h3>\n                                        <p style=\"color: #71717a; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Now serving 200,000+ users in 80 countries with a team of 150 across 5 continents. The journey continues.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "about-4",
      "name": "Team Focused About",
      "description": "Highlights the team culture with photo grid and lead text",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ab4-wrap{padding:100px 20px;background:#f9fafb;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .ab4-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:80px;align-items:center;}\n                          .ab4-grid{flex:1;min-width:300px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px;}\n                          .ab4-img{height:280px;border-radius:16px;}\n                          .ab4-text{flex:1;min-width:300px;}\n                          .ab4-title{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,42px);font-weight:800;color:#111;line-height:1.2;margin:15px 0 20px 0;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.ab4-wrap{padding:60px 20px;} .ab4-inner{gap:40px;flex-direction:column-reverse;} .ab4-img{height:180px;} .ab4-img:nth-child(2){margin-top:0!important;} .ab4-img:nth-child(3){margin-top:0!important;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ab4-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"ab4-inner\">\n                                <!-- Image Grid -->\n                                <div class=\"ab4-grid\">\n                                    <div class=\"ab4-img\" style=\"background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573497019940-1c28c88b4f3e?q=80&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover;\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"ab4-img\" style=\"background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?q=80&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover; margin-top: 30px;\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"ab4-img\" style=\"background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551836022-d5d88e9218df?q=80&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover; margin-top: -30px;\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"ab4-img\" style=\"background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?q=80&w=700&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover;\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Text Content -->\n                                <div class=\"ab4-text\">\n                                    <span style=\"color: #10b981; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px;\">About Us</span>\n                                    <h2 class=\"ab4-title\">People who<br>love what they do</h2>\n                                    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 25px 0;\">We believe that the best products are built by teams that genuinely care. Our culture is built on respect, curiosity, and a shared obsession with quality.</p>\n                                    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 35px 0;\">Remote-first since day one, our team spans 25+ countries, bringing diverse perspectives that make our product truly global.</p>\n                                    <a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 14px 30px; background: #10b981; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px;\">Join Our Team</a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "about-5",
      "name": "Bold Stats About",
      "description": "Minimal centered layout with large impactful statistics",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ab5-wrap{padding:120px 20px;background:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;text-align:center;}\n                          .ab5-title{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,52px);font-weight:900;color:#111;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 25px 0;}\n                          .ab5-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:50px;border-top:1px solid #eee;padding-top:60px;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.ab5-wrap{padding:60px 20px;} .ab5-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:30px;}}\n                          @media(max-width:480px){.ab5-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ab5-wrap\">\n                            <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n                                <h2 class=\"ab5-title\">We're building<br>the internet's future.</h2>\n                                <p style=\"font-size: clamp(16px,2.5vw,20px); color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 80px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">Our tools are trusted by the world's most ambitious teams - from scrappy startups to Fortune 500 enterprises.</p>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"ab5-grid\">\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: clamp(40px,6vw,64px); font-weight: 900; color: #111; line-height: 1;\">98%</div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #888; margin-top: 10px;\">Customer Satisfaction</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: clamp(40px,6vw,64px); font-weight: 900; color: #111; line-height: 1;\">4.2M</div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #888; margin-top: 10px;\">Projects Deployed</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: clamp(40px,6vw,64px); font-weight: 900; color: #111; line-height: 1;\">150+</div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #888; margin-top: 10px;\">Countries Served</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: clamp(40px,6vw,64px); font-weight: 900; color: #111; line-height: 1;\">99.9%</div>\n                                        <div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #888; margin-top: 10px;\">Uptime Guarantee</div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
